# Derived code graph. Rebuilt from source by `tok mem index`, so committing it
# would only produce merge conflicts on a file no human reads. The `**/` prefix
# matters: a pattern with an interior slash is anchored to the repo root, which
# would miss the copies that tests create under fixture directories.
**/.tok/graph/
